Apache-2.0 sources, and downloads Apache-2.0 models on first use.

lib/pose/hands.py and lib/pose/regions.py port logic from OpenCV Zoo's palm_detection_mediapipe and
handpose_estimation_mediapipe demos (Apache License 2.0) and follows
MediaPipe's hand tracking graph (Copyright The MediaPipe Authors, Apache
License 2.0).

track_pose downloads Google's MediaPipe hand landmarker models (Copyright
Google LLC, Apache License 2.0 per the MediaPipe Hands model card) on first
use and converts them to ONNX on the user's machine; no weights are changed or
redistributed by Montaj.


lib/pose/body.py follows MediaPipe's pose landmarker graph and calculators
(Copyright The MediaPipe Authors, Apache License 2.0). track_pose kind body
downloads Google's MediaPipe pose landmarker (full) model, BlazePose GHUM 3D
(Copyright Google LLC, Apache License 2.0 per its model card), on first use and
converts it to ONNX on the user's machine; no weights are changed or
redistributed by Montaj.

